hildren 37\">#37</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_38\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 38\">#38</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_39\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 39\">#39</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_40\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 40\">#40</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background: var(--theme-sticky-nav-background-color); border-radius:4px;\"><font color=\"#E7F0DF\"><i>Before Archer's Peak</i></font>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_0\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 0\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #0</a><br /><b> • </b><br /><i><a href=\"/wiki/A_Monster_Hunter_Walks_into_a_Bar\" title=\"A Monster Hunter Walks into a Bar\">A Monster Hunter Walks into a Bar</a></i>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.previewsworld.com/Catalog/JAN201327\">SOMETHING IS KILLING CHILDREN #6 - PreviewsWorld</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>", "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T22:41:54+00:00"}